=== billing (billing off) :: $ ployz billing
Organization ada: self-hosted, no billing; custom domains allowed.

=== billing --json (billing off) :: $ ployz billing --json
{
  "billing": {
    "custom_domains": true,
    "organization": "ada",
    "plan": "self_hosted"
  }
}

=== billing upgrade (billing off) :: $ ployz billing upgrade
Cloud at http://localhost:34733 has no billing: it is self-hosted

=== billing upgrade --json (billing off) :: $ ployz billing upgrade --json
{"error":{"code":"unsupported","details":null,"message":"Cloud at http://localhost:34733 has no billing: it is self-hosted"}}

=== billing manage (billing off) :: $ ployz billing manage
Cloud at http://localhost:34733 has no billing: it is self-hosted

=== billing manage --json (billing off) :: $ ployz billing manage --json
{"error":{"code":"unsupported","details":null,"message":"Cloud at http://localhost:34733 has no billing: it is self-hosted"}}

